      "blocks": {
        "tab_details": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p>An open top and broad side gussets give the Colette its generous silhouette. Leather wraps the upper handle arcs, and the front belt ends fall separately, each finished with a round gold-tone cap. Approximate dimensions are 50 × 26 × 18 cm (W × H × D), with a 16 cm handle drop.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "content": "<p>Brush the wool gently with a soft garment brush, following the nap. Spot-clean with a barely damp cloth and let it dry naturally. Wipe the leather trim with a dry cloth and store the bag away from direct heat and sunlight.</p>",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "tab_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & delivery",
            "content": "<p>Colette is available to pre-order in all colors, with stock expected to arrive in October 2026. Your order will dispatch once stock arrives. Delivery time is additional and varies by destination. We will send tracking details when it ships. See our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">shipping policy</a> for delivery information.</p>",
