          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Details",
            "content": "<p>Two rolled top handles sit above a softly folded body, with a braided upper edge, inward-falling belt details and warm gold-tone fittings. The approximate dimensions are 38 × 27 × 20 cm (W × H × D).</p>",
