            "alt": "Close-up of the Vivienne’s Chocolate leather grain and contrasting corner trim.",
            "text": "<p>The leather sets the character of the bag. On the Chocolate Vivienne, a richly grained body meets smoother, warmer trim. Selection and cutting establish that balance: the movement of the leather, the shape of each panel, and the soft silhouette that follows.</p>"
